  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> A vicious kick to your left flank ruptures your spleen. Because this organ functions as an important blood filter, this naturally causes serious bleeding! Fortunately the fibrous capsule surrounding the spleen remains intact, which may save your life…</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Bleeding] (1) which can only be removed through magical healing.* Surgery or ordinary Heal Tests don’t work as the bleeding is inside the fibrous capsule surrounding the spleen, impossible to get at. Fortunately, the capsule also contains the bleeding, which will stop after 1d10+5 turns, causing the @Condition[Bleeding] Condition to be removed. \n Because the spleen is an important part of your immune system you’ll lose any Resistance (Disease) Talent that you had.</p>"
    },
